obs RECOVERED AND ADJUSTED, 20260910.020512: this lap never reached a commit -- the round open stashed it at 20260909-212709 and the next Pheromone lap read it back out of the box. The file line above was rewritten to name what actually shipped: the row was booked %673 from a local read and derives to %683 against the anointed spine, since a peer published %673 for a different row while this work sat parked; and the row landed straight onto its own shelf rather than the pin, which stands at 39,994 of 40,960 with fourteen of sixteen rows OPEN. The work was re-proven on metal rather than read off this log -- control 18/0, witness exit 0. This log's own obs on the redleg ceiling corrected the recovering lap, which had already lowered it to 52 before reading here; it stands at 53.
recommend keep-going -- the four remaining unmarked guards in this lane are the same shape and the pen is now written; the meter over the 35 rostered `contains "GREEN"` sites wants Keaton's word first
scope one control fixture, one guard leg sharpened, one ledger row, the card's own block; the redleg ceiling deliberately untouched
status GREEN -- the guard runs 17.2s with its control leg, the control 18 checks and proven able to fail two ways, redleg 52 of 53; the cold pass read 216 guards, 212 green, with stash_record and the roster's own summary of it the only reds, neither this round's
